                                                "sense_id": "cf086c99-8e01-3153-9a0f-a26fccfe4673",
                                                "text": "Thinly-veiled homophobia – this time in early-2000s Hollywood – made Brokeback Mountain an immense challenge for Ossana and her fellow producer James Schamus."
                                            }
